Package: trialLens
Type: Package
Title: Explore Plant Breeding Field Trials
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Emily", "Billow", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "emilybillow27-sudo@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Import T3 phenotype exports, inspect field layouts, summarize missingness, compare observed performance with checks, and generate interactive standalone reports. Comparisons are descriptive and do not adjust for trial design.
